                        <provenance type="#rejected"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_959">Gracedieu,
                                Leicestershire, Priory of St Mary the Virgin and Holy Trinity, of
                                Augustinian nuns</orgName>
                            <p>This attribution was rejected in the second edition of Medieval
                                Libraries of Great Britain (1964), which did not change in the
                                Supplement (1987). However, the attribution was accepted by 1991, as
                                demonstrated by a card in the rejected books section of the Medieval
                                Libraries of Great Britain card index. This card is initialled by
                                Andrew G. Watson and dated 15 April 1991. It principally serves as a
                                cross reference: <q>Rejected in 1964 edn. but now accepted. See card in
                                    main sequence</q>. The corresponding card in the main sequence
                                could not be found during data reconciliation work in 2026. The
                                attribution was overlooked in MLGB3 (2010-2015).</p></provenance>
                    </history>
